WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
ReadyDorm was designed by students for safer shared housing.

00:02.000 --> 00:04.500
The team researched resident, roommate, family, and residence manager needs.

00:04.500 --> 00:06.500
The design prioritizes low cognitive load, accessible controls, and fast decisions.

00:06.500 --> 00:08.000
The final prototype includes videos, a responsive landing page, a product detail page, and GitHub Pages deployment.
